#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:5 0183671762004223b5ecd9a4565d0ed7
msgid "Pilot Control"
msgstr "飞手控制"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:7 56a8ee31de624e77b5285f489d2f8600
msgid "Control of the vehicle can be accomplished in three ways:"
msgstr "飞行器的控制可通过以下三种方式实现："

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:9 7ab6fc78a6f249c996c7ac9a6aa32391
msgid "Via Ground Control Stations using:"
msgstr "通过地面控制站使用："

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:11 38ff2e5124ab4b0bb6e26d6734134e42
msgid ""
"GCS attached Joysticks, or command lines, to send `MAVLink RC overrides "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/services/manual_control.html#alternatives>`__ that "
"act as RC inputs (even if no RC receiver is attached)"
msgstr ""
"连接到地面站的摇杆或命令行，发送 `MAVLink 遥控覆盖 "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/services/manual_control.html#alternatives>`__ "
"作为遥控输入（即使未连接遥控接收机）"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:12 6024c3f9526c460eb1271734df3f7d89
msgid ""
"The `MAVLink Manual Control protocol "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/services/manual_control.html>`__, which includes axis"
" commands and button states."
msgstr ""
"`MAVLink 手动控制协议 "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/services/manual_control.html>`__，包含轴控制命令和按钮状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:14 c99107be91b04ff7888a1317984977e0
msgid ""
"For `legacy reasons <https://github.com/ardupilot/ardupilot/issues/8818>`__,"
" ArduSub's `MANUAL_CONTROL "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MANUAL_CONTROL>`__ support "
"expects Z-axis values in range [0,1000], instead of the specification range "
"[-1000,1000]."
msgstr ""
"出于 `历史原因 <https://github.com/ardupilot/ardupilot/issues/8818>`__，ArduSub 的 "
"`MANUAL_CONTROL "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MANUAL_CONTROL>`__ 支持期望 Z 轴值范围为 "
"[0,1000]，而非规范范围 [-1000,1000]。"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:16 b95ca1cff3454f058618f3f9d872b518
msgid "RC control (not enabled by default)"
msgstr "遥控控制（默认未启用）"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:19 4bb4967d1e994f93ad7c29005ab67478
msgid "Pilot Control Inputs"
msgstr "飞手控制输入"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:20 9ea2c4a9306344abb3330680171e0e80
msgid ""
"If RC is not enabled, pilot inputs are via the GCS joystick, controlling the"
" vehicle's available motion axes, including yaw and attitude rotations, "
"along with body-frame translations laterally, forward/back, and up/down in "
"depth. Additionally, lights and camera can be controlled from the GCS, as "
"well as some generic servo and/or relay outputs."
msgstr ""
"若未启用遥控，飞手输入通过地面站摇杆进行，控制飞行器的可用运动轴，包括偏航和姿态旋转，以及机体坐标系下的横向、前后和深度上下平移。此外，还可通过地面站控制灯光和摄像头，以及部分通用舵机和/或继电器输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:22 e6692d271bce4c8abdcadbff9674b04e
msgid ""
"If RC is enabled, then the pitch/roll/yaw/throttle/lateral/forward inputs "
"are sent from the RC transmitter and mapped from RC channels to these inputs"
" via the ``RCMAP_`` parameters."
msgstr "若启用了遥控，则俯仰/横滚/偏航/油门/横向/前向输入由遥控发射机发送，并通过 ``RCMAP_`` 参数将遥控通道映射至相应输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:25 ba195b45c64544898a78157b284a1d73
msgid "Pilot Control Freedoms by Mode"
msgstr "各模式下的飞手控制自由度"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:26 1c44b999ce7b48c3adb883f93efa2125
msgid ""
"The following assumes the axis is controllable. Some frame configurations do"
" not provide all axes. For example the SimpleROV-3 frame has three thrusters"
" providing only yaw, forwad, and depth control. The pitch and roll attitude "
"is uncontrolled and relies on CG/ballast trimming and has no lateral "
"movement capability."
msgstr ""
"以下内容假设该轴可控。某些机架配置并不提供所有轴的控制能力。例如，SimpleROV-3 "
"机架具有三个推进器，仅提供偏航、前向和深度控制。俯仰和横滚姿态不受控，依赖重心/压载配平，且无横向运动能力。"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:28 de1c0d1c81524e4d98bea60e82ccc489
msgid "ANG = Angle target. Stick deflection indicates desired axis angle."
msgstr "ANG = 角度目标。摇杆偏转表示期望的轴角度。"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:30 90a192edf0c049c288fcad3b92db7dd1
msgid ""
"RAT = Rate target. Stick deflection indicates desired axis movement/rotation"
" rate."
msgstr "RAT = 角速率目标。摇杆偏转表示期望的轴运动/旋转速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:32 59f885eec6a94684b4a4df65a82ab7ca
msgid "D = Direct motor output based on stick deflection."
msgstr "D = 基于摇杆偏转的直接电机输出。"

